# LEGO Capability Retrieval

This workspace is a LEGO micro-app. Default to `micro-app` context.

Before answering or editing code for LEGO capabilities, run:

```powershell
node docs/ai/search-lego-capabilities.mjs "<user question>" --context micro-app
```

Use only returned methods, parameters, constraints, and call patterns. If no method matches, report that the local LEGO capability library has no match.

- Host services use `callBase` from `@/bridge.js`.
- Host maps use `mapRef.value`.
- Local `<TGisMap>` maps use `realMapRef.value`.
- Generated files under `docs/ai/` must not be edited manually.
